   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4e37efba",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 6. Target Variable Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "This is a multiclass classification problem. Most classes are not equally represented, which is why macro-average metrics are more informative than raw accuracy."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 25,
   "id": "bb7b54a3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
