    "print(\"Train target distribution:\")\n",
    "print(y_train.value_counts())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4638acf9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 9. Feature Scaling\n",
    "\n",
    "Scaling is fit only on the training data and then applied to both sets. This prevents information leakage from the test set."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "0045f84a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
